# Admin UI Backlog and Milestone Spec

## Purpose

Every admin UI backlog item must be **implementable without guessing**: what appears on the page, where it sits, how it is built, in what order, which styles apply, and which documented failures to avoid.

Cross-ref: `ui.mdc` (layout, cold path, chips), `frontend-modular.mdc` (package map), `react.mdc` (DoD, perf), `MILESTONE_TEMPLATE.md` (skeleton), `anti-slop.mdc` (lie modes).

## Two-tier backlog

| Tier | File | Role |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Index | `deploy/vendor/admin_ui_redesign_backlog.md` | Slug list, ship order, links to milestone specs |
| Page catalog | `deploy/vendor/admin_web_pages_backlog.md` | Routes, APIs, page content, gaps, ship waves |
| Milestone requirements | `deploy/vendor/ADMIN_MILESTONES_REQUIREMENTS.md` | Detailed requirements per slug (foundation, patterns, all pages) |
| Spec | `deploy/vendor/ADMIN_<SLUG>_MILESTONE.md` | Copy from template + requirements; sections 4.1–4.7 per page |

**Banned:** a row in `admin_ui_redesign_backlog.md` that says only "implement customers page" with no linked milestone file filled through section 7.

| Rule | Detail |
| :--- | :--- |
| Path | `deploy/vendor/` flat — no subfolder |
| Filename | UPPERCASE `ADMIN_<SLUG>_MILESTONE.md` or `ADMIN_<PATTERN>_MILESTONE_<PAGE>.md` |
| Template base | Copy `MILESTONE_TEMPLATE.md` sections 1–9 |
| Domain rules line | `Domain rules: ui.mdc, frontend-modular.mdc, react.mdc, ui-backlog.mdc` |
| Gate | Sections **1.1–1.4**, **4** (all UI subsections below), **5**, **6**, **7** complete — no placeholders |

Status flow: `DRAFT` → `IN_PROGRESS` → `REVIEW` → `SHIPPED`. Code lands only from `REVIEW` when operator asked to implement.

## What the index backlog must contain

Each row in `admin_ui_redesign_backlog.md`:

| Column | Required content |
| :--- | :--- |
| Slug | Semantic slug (`admin_directory_customers`) |
| Spec file | Link to `ADMIN_*_MILESTONE*.md` |
| Depends on | Prior slugs (`admin_shell`, `admin_contract_gate`, …) |
| Pattern | `directory` \| `detail` \| `report` \| `shell` \| `hub` |
| API ready | `yes` / `no` — if `no`, handler milestone slug first |

Index does **not** replace milestone section 4. Index row without spec file = not startable.

## Milestone section 4 — UI design spec (mandatory for admin)

Section 4 of `MILESTONE_TEMPLATE.md` is insufficient for admin UI until **all subsections below** are filled. No mood words; observable structure only.

### 4.1 Page inventory (what is on the page)

Table: every visible region and control.

| Region ID | Component / section | Purpose | Data source (API field or static) |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `context` | ContextBar | Tenant / scope breadcrumb | URL + `GET ...` if needed |
| `chrome` | PageChrome | Title + optional freshness chip | `freshness_label`, `stale` |
| `toolbar` | Toolbar | Primary actions (create, export) | Route + permissions |
| `filters` | FilterPanel | Search, sort, facet fields | Query params → handler |
| `content` | Data grid / form / report | Main body | `items[]` or PATCH DTO |
| `footer` | Pagination / save bar | Page nav or mutation | `total`, `limit`, `offset` |

List **empty**, **loading**, **error**, and **501 stub** behavior per region (`ui.mdc` Fetch and error UI).

### 4.2 Route and navigation (where the page lives)

| Field | Spec |
| :--- | :--- |
| Path | `/admin/...` SPA route |
| Nav group | Shell nav label + icon key |
| RBAC | Permission strings from OpenAPI `x-permissions` |
| `live: true` | Only if `/api/v1` backend exists |
| Deep links | Query params preserved on refresh |

### 4.3 Layout and placement (grid contract)

ASCII or table — section stack top to bottom (`ui.mdc`):

```
ContextBar -> PageChrome -> Toolbar -> [FilterPanel] -> Content -> Footer
```

Per section:

| Section | `grid-template` | Columns (`--<profile>-cols`) | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| FilterPanel | `grid` rows/cols | Field widths in `rem` | `overflow: visible` when dropdown open |
| Content (grid) | `role="grid"` + subgrid | Name fixed `rem`; money `start`; status `center` | No `<table>` |
| Footer | single row grid | Prev \| range \| Next | |

Forbidden unless milestone explicitly waives: flex on page/section, portal field listboxes, fixed filter drawer, nested `*Chrome` wrappers.

### 4.4 Styles and tokens (how it looks)

| Topic | Spec |
| :--- | :--- |
| CSS ownership | `web/src/ui/<domain>/*.module.css` only — pages never import modules |
| Tokens | `var(--space-*)`, `var(--text-*)` from `tokens.css` — no hard-coded hex |
| Chips | One layer; symmetric `padding: var(--space-1)`; labels from API |
| Field listbox | Inline `.drop`; wrapper `width: 100%` |
| Variants | `*.variants.ts` + `cn()` string-only in row loop |
| Z-index | Cell raise when `[data-dropdown-open]` |

Name CSS module files and grid profile token (`--customers-cols`).

### 4.5 API and cold path (what the browser does not compute)

| Concern | Handler / OpenAPI | Browser |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Filter, sort, search | Query params documented | URL → `helpers/*_api.ts` |
| Pagination | `limit`, `offset`, `total` | Refetch on change |
| Display fields | `*_display`, `*_label`, `status_tone` | Render only |
| PATCH body | Go struct fields | Form fields 1:1 |
| Export | Endpoint + async job if any | Download / poll UI |

If a column needs a field not in OpenAPI: **handler + OpenAPI row in section 5 step 1** — not invented in TS.

### 4.6 File map (where code lands)

| Path | Role |
| :--- | :--- |
| `web/src/pages/<name>_page.tsx` | Compose; <= ~120 lines |
| `web/src/ui/<domain>/...` | Sections + CSS modules |
| `web/src/helpers/<domain>_api.ts` | Fetch + parse |
| `api/openapi/paths/...` | If contract changes |
| `internal/.../handlers.go` | If handler changes |

Banned new paths: `web/src/components/` (extend `ui/system/` or domain), `models/`, `dto/`, `providers/`.

### 4.7 Pitfalls checklist (avoid documented failures)

Copy applicable rows; add milestone-specific risks in 1.1.

| Pitfall | Prevention in this milestone |
| :--- | :--- |
| Client filter/sort over full `items[]` | Server params listed in 4.5 |
| Wrapper stack (`*DirectoryChrome`) | One section = one `ui/<domain>/` folder |
| Double chip chrome | PageChrome slot renders chip directly |
| Phantom width contract | Column template in 4.3 |
| Narrow/wide listbox | Inline drop + wrapper width in 4.4 |
| Silent `catch` → empty table | ErrorBlock row in 4.1 |
| `live: true` without API | 4.2 RBAC + handler path |
| Demo KPIs / `(skeleton)` copy | StubBanner on 501 only |
| Legacy `ghost_*` naming | `silent_reject_*` per `naming.mdc` |
| Perf: full list render | Server page + windowing note in 4.5 / section 6 (`react.mdc`) |
| Piecemeal `web/` edit | Atomic paths in section 5 |

Empty pitfall table = milestone not startable.

## Milestone section 5 — implementation order (admin)

Default order — adjust only with `Depends on` note:

| Step | Layer | Artifacts | Done when |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 1 | Contract | OpenAPI + handler DTO if new fields | `openapi_gate.sh` |
| 2 | Types | `make openapi-types` | `web/src/types/generated/` updated |
| 3 | Transport | `helpers/<domain>_api.ts` | Parse only; no business rules |
| 4 | Domain UI | `ui/<domain>/*` + CSS modules | Matches 4.3–4.4 |
| 5 | Page | `pages/*_page.tsx` | Compose only; URL params |
| 6 | Route | Router registration + nav entry | Route loads |
| 7 | Embed | `web/dist` if shipping | `TestAdminStaticRoutes` / typecheck |

**One PR** = one page + its domain folder + one helper unless milestone section 5 explicitly splits with `Depends on`.

Forbidden order: TSX before OpenAPI; CSS in `pages/`; extend `components/` monolith.

## Milestone section 6 — UI performance

For directory/report pages with large N:

| Surface | Target | How measured |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Scroll | < 16 ms/frame | Profiler + row window in 4.3 |
| Filter apply | Spike on Apply only | Allocation sampling (`react.mdc`) |
| Ticker | No full-page commit | Isolated leaf in 4.1 |

Shell-only milestones: `N/A` with reason.

## Milestone section 7 — verification (admin)

Minimum rows:

```bash
cd web && npm run typecheck
bash scripts/ci/check_ui_surface_gate.sh
bash scripts/ci/admin_web.sh
bash scripts/ci/openapi_gate.sh   # when contract touched
```

| Check | Pass criteria |
| :--- | :--- |
| Manual | Empty / error / loading states per 4.1 |
| Contract | Every form field on Go PATCH struct |
| Layout | No flex page layout; grid columns match 4.3 |

## Pattern milestones vs page milestones

| Pattern slug | Spec file | Section 4 focus |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `admin_directory_pattern` | `ADMIN_DIRECTORY_MILESTONE_<PAGE>.md` | 4.1 grid + server pagination |
| `admin_detail_pattern` | `ADMIN_DETAIL_MILESTONE_<PAGE>.md` | 4.1 form fields = PATCH DTO |
| `admin_report_pattern` | `ADMIN_REPORT_MILESTONE_<REPORT>.md` | Report keys from handler catalog |
| `admin_shell` | `ADMIN_SHELL_MILESTONE.md` | Nav, login, boot — no domain grid |

First page milestone **copies** pattern slug done-when; repeats 4.3–4.4 with page-specific columns.

## Agent rules

| Situation | Action |
| :--- | :--- |
| Operator asks for backlog row | Write/update milestone spec sections 4.1–4.7 — not code |
| Operator asks to implement | Milestone `REVIEW` + section 7 commands |
| Missing 4.3 column widths | Stop — fill grid contract first |
| API field missing | Section 5 step 1 handler — not TS-only field |
| Rejected layout | Revert slice; update 4.3 invariant — no wrapper stack |

